{# =====================================================
   CONTACT — WEBSITE V2
   Rebuilt to sit on the same visual system as homepage-v2.njk /
   industry.njk / product-v2.njk: navbar-v2 + footer-v2 chrome,
   Inter type, flat #F8FAFC body, navy/#76B900 token language,
   glass-surface cards, font-mono uppercase labels.

   Contact form is a native form (Alpine.js) posting to this site's
   own /api/submit-lead serverless function, which holds the real
   CRM bearer token server-side and forwards to edgex.zunkireelabs.com
   — see api/submit-lead.js. The token used to be hardcoded directly
   in this file's client-side JS, publicly readable via view-source;
   moved server-side 2026-09-28 after that was flagged as a real
   security issue. Quick-link destinations and site.* data bindings
   are unchanged.
   ===================================================== #}

{% include "partials/navbar-v2.njk" %}

<script>
  document.documentElement.classList.add('js-reveal-hidden');
</script>
<style>
  .js-reveal-hidden [data-reveal]:not(.revealed),
  .js-reveal-hidden [data-reveal-stagger]:not(.revealed) > * {
    opacity: 0;
  }
  /* Country-code dropdown list already scrolls (max-h-64 overflow-y-auto) —
     macOS/most browsers just hide the scrollbar until actively scrolling,
     so it read as cut-off/broken. Force it visible as a thin track instead. */
  .country-scroll {
    scrollbar-width: thin;
    scrollbar-color: #d1d5db transparent;
  }
  .country-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: 6px;
  }
  .country-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
    background: transparent;
  }
  .country-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background-color: #d1d5db;
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }
</style>

